id: bootloader_application_properties_header
label: Bootloader application properties header
package: bootloader
description: >
  Header-only owner for common/api/application_properties.h (series-neutral; single
  package-analysis owner). Application tag metadata declarations used by bootloader core and
  GBL format headers; kept in the bootloader package. Lives under platform/bootloader/common/api
  so the cross-series owner does not expose Series-2-private headers from platform/bootloader/api
  on Series-3 builds. Consumers resolve it via requires.
category: Platform|Bootloader|Core
quality: production
ui_hints:
  visibility: never
include:
- path: platform/bootloader/common/api
  file_list:
  - path: application_properties.h
provides:
- name: bootloader_application_properties_header
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: MSLA
root_path: bootloader
